      "writtenOn": "2016-05-09T22:35:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is not correct. The point of having deterministic as a property of the Sub Expression is that you could have one or more Sub Expressions that are non-deterministic and one or more that are deterministic. Otherwise, deterministic should just be a property of the Alarm Definition.\n\nI believe the changes in SubAlarmStats are sufficient.",
