      "lineNbr": 189,
      "author": {
        "id": 16168
      },
      "writtenOn": "2016-05-10T11:17:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "But it may happen that all sub expressions are non-deterministic\n\nAlso this method returns true only if all sub expressions are non-deterministic. So, I assumed that the case here is similar to the one we had with sporadic metrics. If all metrics were to be sporadic we would immediately transition to ok. Also I wanted to present a detail msg for the notifications that something like that has happened.\n\nAs far as I know this is the place where the reason why state has been changed is computed, so if my assumption is wrong, let me know, I will fix that.",
      "parentUuid": "dab17558_679d0459",
